{"title":"Skeleton","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 7 Skeleton that attacks with stab (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=4\">Lv 4 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=5\">Lv 5 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=7\">Lv 7</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=9\">Lv 9 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" 